                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de36f39f-99f1-39f4-817e-5e1e4d87456a",
                        "entry_id": "58631d16-c340-33c5-bc0c-28775b7997da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to rage, to rampage"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38cdfb9f-a8b1-439f-b00e-239fbc38a449",
                                "sense_id": "de36f39f-99f1-39f4-817e-5e1e4d87456a",
                                "text": "— Го́споди Иису́се! — завопи́ла фу́рия, — да ты кто тако́в навяза́лся! Ты с ней пришёл, что ли? Да я сейча́с к ча́стному при́ставу! Да меня́ сам Андро́н Тимофе́ич как благоро́дную почита́ет! Что она́, к тебе́, что ли, хо́дит? Кто тако́й? В чужо́й дом буя́нить пришёл. Карау́л!",
                                "translation": "“Lord Jesus!” cried the fury. “But who are you, poking your nose in! Did you come with her, eh? I’ll go straight to the police-captain! Andrey Timofeyitch himself treats me like a lady. Why, is it to see you she goes, eh? Who is it? He’s come to make an upset in another person’s house. Police!”",
                                "english": "“Lord Jesus!” cried the fury. “But who are you, poking your nose in! Did you come with her, eh? I’ll go straight to the police-captain! Andrey Timofeyitch himself treats me like a lady. Why, is it to see you she goes, eh? Who is it? He’s come to make an upset in another person’s house. Police!”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
